Modifications & Additions:
- Developed native Bionic-to-Glibc translation layer (libandroid_shim.so).
- Neutralized dynamic versioning tags (DT_VERDEF/DT_VERDEFNUM) in libbarhopper_v3_patched.so
  for native Linux x86_64 and NVIDIA Jetson AArch64 dynamic linker compatibility.
- Implemented C++ and Python native zero-copy camera pipeline APIs.
- Extracted and structured embedded TensorFlow Lite models and neural pipeline architecture.
